{"title":"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f87a642101596771dc90b02ac5064ca52f9e7ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{10^2-9^2}{10+9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"70\" height=\"42\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/8/048d067cca7a824e6a66681f354522b38588cda8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^{2} - 9^{2}}{10 + 9} = \\frac{100 - 81}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"166\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/2/88206d305944b51a064e75e055e73549e6d65ab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{19}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efb15efd57dc98ffdb84c465473552ad0f77fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c00c5c3bc3045f1792c4dc4a31a88d676049d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2 - b^2}{a + b} = \\frac{(a + b)(a - b)}{a + b} = a - b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"260\" height=\"42\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a94fe6192226e0fc83c328fd60cc763b216fc95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\neq -b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/3037a13fd47376889ca8e5ff4c1c2b699b65d1e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^{2} - 9^{2}}{10 + 9} = 10 - 9 = \\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"189\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1416/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.772      1 2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.772      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36012:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000247 and revision id 279627. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}